        1   using Progress.Lang.*.
        2   using Progress.Windows.Form.
        3   block-level on error undo, throw.
        4   class ibs.th.ref.incas inherits Form:
        5      define private variable Bt_ok as System.Windows.Forms.Button no-undo.
        6      define private variable button1 as System.Windows.Forms.Button no-undo.
